ionable advice\n\"\"\".trimIndent()\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Composables\n\n```kotlin\n// Message Bubble\n@Composable\nfun PawSyncMessageBubble(\n message: ChatMessage,\n onCopyMessage: () -> Unit,\n onShareMessage: () -> Unit\n)\n\n// Model Card\n@Composable\nfun PetAIModelCard(\n model: ModelInfo,\n isLoaded: Boolean,\n onDownload: () -> Unit,\n onLoad: () -> Unit\n)\n\n// Quick Question Chip\n@Composable\nfun QuickQuestionChip(\n label: String,\n icon: String,\n onClick: () -> Unit\n)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Debug Logcat Filters\n\n```\nPAWSYNC # All app logs\nRunAnywhere # SDK logs\nLlamaCpp # Model inference\nDownload # Model downloads\n```\n\n---\n\n## Testing Checklist\n\n- [ ] Welcome screen animations work\n- [ ] Pet registration saves data\n- [ ] Dashboard displays metrics\n- [ ] AI Chat tab accessible\n- [ ] Model selector opens\n- [ ] Model downloads with progress\n- [ ] Model loads successfully\n- [ ] Chat accepts input\n- [ ] AI generates streaming responses\n- [ ] Quick questions work\n- [ ] Model switching works\n- [ ] Navigation between tabs works\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues & Fixes\n\n| Issue | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Model download fails | Check internet, try WiFi |\n| Model won't load | Ensure download complete, restart app |\n| App crashes during generation | Use smaller model (SmolLM2) |\n| Slow responses | Normal for on-device AI, wait patiently |\n| \"Please load model\" error | Download and load a model first |\n| SDK init fails | Check logcat for specific error |\n\n---\n\n## Performance Tips\n\n```kotlin\n// In AndroidManifest.xml (already set)\nandroid:largeHeap=\"true\" // ✅ Allows more memory\n\n// Best practices\n- Load only one model at a time\n- Close background apps during generation\n- First generation is slower (warmup)\n- Clear chat history periodically\n- Test on real device for best results\n```\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```gradle\n// Core\nKotlin 1.9+\nJetpack Compose\nMaterial Design 3\n\n// AI\nRunAnywhere SDK (AAR)\nllama.