ewModelScope.launch {\n _state.value = UiState.Loading\n try {\n val result = repository.getData()\n _state.value = UiState.Success(result)\n } catch (e: Exception) {\n _state.value = UiState.Error(e.message)\n }\n }\n }\n}\n\n// Composable\n@Composable\nfun Screen(viewModel: MyViewModel = viewModel()) {\n val state by viewModel.state.collectAsState()\n \n when (state) {\n is UiState.Loading -> LoadingUI()\n is UiState.Success -> SuccessUI(data)\n is UiState.Error -> ErrorUI(message)\n }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Model Selection Guide\n\n| Your Device | Recommended Model |\n|------------|-------------------|\n| 2GB RAM, limited storage | SmolLM2 360M (119 MB) |\n| 3-4GB RAM, moderate storage | Qwen 2.5 0.5B ✅ (374 MB) |\n| 6GB+ RAM, ample storage | Llama 3.2 1B (815 MB) |\n\n---\n\n## Support Resources\n\n- **GitHub Issues**: Report bugs\n- **Logcat**: Check \"PAWSYNC\" tag\n- **Documentation**: Read README.md\n- **SDK Docs**: See QUICK_START_ANDROID.md\n- **AI Guide**: See AI_CHAT_GUIDE.md\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Pre-Launch Checklist\n\n- [ ] SDK AAR files in `app/libs/`\n- [ ] Internet permission in manifest\n- [ ] `largeHeap=\"true\"` in manifest\n- [ ] All models registered in MyApplication\n- [ ] Navigation flow tested\n- [ ] AI chat tested with at least one model\n- [ ] UI is responsive on target devices\n- [ ] No lint errors\n- [ ] App builds successfully\n\n---\n\n## Key Features Summary\n\n✅ On-device AI (no cloud)\n✅ 3 downloadable models\n✅ Real-time streaming chat\n✅ Pet profile system\n✅ Health metrics integration\n✅ Context-aware AI\n✅ Material Design 3 UI\n✅ Professional architecture\n✅ Comprehensive documentation\n\n---\n\n**Last Updated**: Implementation complete\n**Status**: Ready for testing and demo\n**Next**: Build, install, test AI chat! \n"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"edit_file","tool_call_id":"toolu_011EmqmJsPEtoToRbtNiJEjH","content":"The apply model made the following changes to the file:

